  "description": "GUGWIQ crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C128 H156 Dy4 Fe4 N4 O36,C2 H3 N1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Fe1 (Fe) has 5 O neighbors; Fe2 (Fe) has 5 O neighbors; Fe3 (Fe) has 5 O neighbors; Fe4 (Fe) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.357-4.587 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 98.04-135.09°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C130H159Dy4Fe4N5O36. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
